  "label": "intended audience",
  "description": "The meme is designed to target individuals who hold or are influenced by anti-Latino/Hispanic racist ideologies, particularly those who may be sympathetic to or influenced by Donald Trump's rhetoric on immigration and who are likely to consume and share such hateful content. The target audience is drawn to the meme through its use of a recognizable political figure (Donald Trump) and its invocation of a widely understood racist stereotype (equating Latinos with roaches to be raided), which appeals to those who support or are ideologically aligned with xenophobic and racially charged narratives against Latinos.",
